[null,true,"third",true,["1,first,second,third","2,fourth,fifth,sixth"],null,"fifth",["2,fourth,fifth,sixth"]]

**Explanation:**

// Creates three tables.
SQL sql = new SQL(["one", "two", "three"], [2, 3, 1]);

// Adds a row to the table "two" with id 1. Returns True.
